## 3) What Was Implemented

### 3.1 Admin Event Creation (New Backend API)

A new API endpoint was added for admin event creation with single-submit behavior.

- Endpoint: POST /api/admin/events
- Input supports:
  - title
  - description
  - moreDescription
  - domain
  - highlights
  - timeline
  - date
  - thumbnailUrl
  - detailImageUrl
- Behavior:
  - Validates payload with Zod.
  - Inserts into events table.
  - Optionally inserts detail data into event_slug table.
  - Optionally inserts thumbnail into posters table.
  - Returns success response with created event id.
- Added duplicate-title conflict handling (unique violation code 23505 path handling).

### 3.2 Admin Validation Layer (New Validator)

A dedicated validator file was added for the admin event payload.

- Validates required and optional fields.
- Date format enforced as YYYY-MM-DD.
- URL fields validated for thumbnail/detail image.

### 3.3 Admin Dashboard UI (Form Replacement)

The placeholder admin dashboard page was replaced with a working client-side event creation form.

- Controlled inputs for all event fields.
- Submit posts JSON to POST /api/admin/events.
- Shows user-facing success and error messages.
- Includes thumbnail and detail image URL fields as requested.

